A bipedal '''species''' had [[Color|gray]] [[Hair|fur]] and brown horns, skin, and [[eye]]s.<ref name="SoloOG" />

Around [[33 BBY]], before the [[Clone Wars]], a member of this species was an accomplice of [[Fissark Tozan]]. They were killed by [[Jango Fett]] when he came to collect a [[Bounty hunter|bounty]] on Tozan.<ref name="Jango1">[[Jango Fett 1|''Jango Fett'' 1]]</ref> Later, during the [[Imperial Era]] in [[10 BBY]], a member of this species named [[Susaut Volupicite]] was present at [[the Lodge]] on [[Vandor]] when [[Tobias Beckett]], [[Qi'ra]], [[Han Solo]] and [[Chewbacca]] arrived in search of [[Landonis Balthazar Calrissian|Lando Calrissian]].<ref name="SoloOG" />

Later again in [[2 BBY]], a third member of this species served as a [[Rebel trooper|soldier]] for the newly formed [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] at its [[Massassi Site|base]] on [[Yavin 4]].<ref name="Messenger">{{Andor|Messenger}}</ref>

